{{Quote|Qi'ra, remember the Silo? We pulled you out of that horror, gave you a home. Don't throw it away for Han. He's not worth it!|[[Lady]] [[Proxima]], to [[Qi'ra]]|<ref name="Solo Expanded Edition">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story: Expanded Edition]]''</ref>}}
The '''Silo''' was a work camp located in the [[Bottoms]] of [[Coronet City]] on the [[planet]] [[Corellia]]. The Silo territory was infamous as a place run by some of the nastiest people on Corellia, where the life expectancy of its orphans was less than eighteen [[standard year]]s old. [[Qi'ra]] grew up in the Silo and maintained a secret [[Qi'ra's safe house|safe house]] within the [[freighter boneyard]]. People referred to the Silo as Corellian [[Chaos|hell]], but Qi'ra claimed that it was worse.<ref name="Most Wanted" />

